{"mention_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m013-0214","chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p013","quote":"太子"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m013-0221","chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p013","quote":"太子"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m013-0224","chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p013","quote":"太子"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m013-0231","chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p013","quote":"太子"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m013-0251","chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p013","quote":"太子"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m053-0016","chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p053","quote":"太子"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","source_id":"s-shiji-037-wei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p013","quote":"十八年，初，宣公愛夫人夷姜，夷姜生子伋，以爲太子，而令右公子傅之。右公子爲太子取齊女，未入室，而宣公見所欲爲太子婦者好，説而自取之，更爲太子取他女。宣公得齊女，生子壽、子朔，令左公子傅之。太子伋母死，宣公正夫人與朔共讒惡太子伋。宣公自以其奪太子妻也，心惡太子，欲廢之。及聞其惡，大怒，乃使太子伋於齊而令盜遮界上殺之，與太子白旄，而告界盜見持白旄者殺之。且行，子朔之兄壽，太子異母弟也，知朔之惡太子而君欲殺之，乃謂太子曰：「界盜見太子白旄，卽殺太子，太子可毋行。」太子曰：「逆父命求生，不可。」遂行。壽見太子不止，乃盜其白旄而先馳至界。界盜見其驗，卽殺之。壽已死，而太子伋又至，謂盜曰：「所當殺乃我也。」盜并殺太子伋，以報宣公。宣公乃以子朔爲太子。十九年，宣公卒，太子朔立，是爲惠公。","source_term":"宣公愛夫人夷姜，夷姜生子伋"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji037-027","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"qy1_adc_gam"}},{"id":"qy1_adc_gam_AA","label":"太子伋之子（未名）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"子","mention_ids":["c-shiji-037-wei:m020-anonymous-son"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m020-anonymous-son","chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p020","quote":"子"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","source_id":"s-shiji-037-wei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p020","quote":"初，翟殺懿公也，衞人憐之，思復立宣公前死太子伋之後，伋子又死，而代伋死者子壽又無子。太子伋同母弟二人：其一曰黔牟，黔牟嘗代惠公爲君，八年復去；其二曰昭伯。昭伯、黔牟皆已前死，故立昭伯子申爲戴公。戴公卒，復立其弟燬爲文公。","source_term":"伋子又死"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji037-073","interpretation_note":"以伋子明示父子配置家族分支，字元不表示排行，未知母親及姓名不補。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"qy1_adc_gam_A"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-037-wei","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-037","chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-037-wei:m020-anonymous-son"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-037-wei:p020"],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-037-wei"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-shiji037-073","subject_person_id":"qy1_adc_gam_AA","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"qy1_adc_gam_A","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","source_id":"s-shiji-037-wei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p020","quote":"初，翟殺懿公也，衞人憐之，思復立宣公前死太子伋之後，伋子又死，而代伋死者子壽又無子。太子伋同母弟二人：其一曰黔牟，黔牟嘗代惠公爲君，八年復去；其二曰昭伯。昭伯、黔牟皆已前死，故立昭伯子申爲戴公。戴公卒，復立其弟燬爲文公。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"伋子","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"未名兒子父為伋，原文未記母親、出生或排行；不由名字補世系。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","source_id":"s-shiji-037-wei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p020","quote":"初，翟殺懿公也，衞人憐之，思復立宣公前死太子伋之後，伋子又死，而代伋死者子壽又無子。太子伋同母弟二人：其一曰黔牟，黔牟嘗代惠公爲君，八年復去；其二曰昭伯。昭伯、黔